message: "If you use this artifact, please cite the accompanying paper when available; otherwise cite this software repository."
title: "Compositional Verification of PMP-IOPMP Isolation in RISC-V SoCs"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Public artifact for compositional verification of PMP-IOPMP isolation in
  RISC-V SoCs, including real-Ibex validation, reset-ordering analysis,
  formal verification, simulation, and SKY130HD post-route PPA evaluation.
repository-code: "https://github.com/MMR000/riscv-pmp-iopmp-compositional-verification"
